<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Blutech" description="Blutech website privacy policy covering contact enquiries, analytics, cookies and data handling." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="kicker">Legal</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: 22 August 2026</p></div></section>
  <section><article class="shell article"><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This policy explains how Blutech IoT Limited (“Blutech”, “we”, “us”) handles personal information submitted through blutech.io and related website enquiry functions.</p><h2>2. Information we collect</h2><p>When you contact us, we may receive your name, company, work email, phone number, enquiry type, message and other information you choose to provide. We may also receive standard technical information such as browser type, device type, referring page and website usage data if analytics is enabled.</p><h2>3. How we use information</h2><p>We use submitted information to respond to enquiries, evaluate projects or partnerships, provide requested product or technical information, maintain website security and improve our services. We do not sell personal information to advertisers.</p><h2>4. Analytics and cookies</h2><p>The site is designed to operate without advertising trackers. If website analytics is enabled, it is used to understand aggregate site usage and conversion events. Where consent is required for a deployed analytics configuration, the production site should enable the corresponding consent mechanism before tracking.</p><h2>5. Service providers</h2><p>Blutech may use service providers for website hosting, email delivery, security and analytics. They process information only for the relevant service and subject to their contractual and technical controls.</p><h2>6. Retention</h2><p>Enquiry information is retained only as long as reasonably necessary for the business purpose, contractual requirements, security, record keeping or legal obligations. Project or customer records may be subject to separate contractual retention requirements.</p><h2>7. Security</h2><p>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect website and enquiry information. No Internet transmission or storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p><h2>8. Your questions or requests</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests relating to information you submitted through this website, contact <a href="mailto:enquiry@blutech.io">enquiry@blutech.io</a>.</p><h2>9. Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy when website features, service providers or legal requirements change. The latest version will be published on this page.</p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
